@base = localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 14. GET room count (expect 200, 3 -- console shows select count(*))
GET http://{{base}}/count

### 15. Reservations of room 1, ordered by start (expect 200, 3: Mina, Omar, Lucas)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations

### 16. Reservations of a room that does not exist (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99/reservations

### 17. Book room 1 for Kim, 14 Oct 10-11 (expect 201, Location /api/reservations/6)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-14T11:00:00" }

### 18. Overlaps Mina's 6 Oct 10-11 booking (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:30:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T11:30:00" }

### 19. Starts exactly when Mina ends (expect 201, Location /api/reservations/7)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-06T11:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T12:00:00" }

### 20. End before start (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-14T11:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00" }

### 21. Room does not exist (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-14T11:00:00" }

### 22. Mina's reservations (expect 200, 2 items, one select in the console)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations?reservedBy=Mina

### 23. Delete a room that has reservations (expect 409)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 24. DELETE a room that has reservations, via {{base}} (expect 409)
DELETE http://{{base}}/1

### 25. PUT with capacity above the allowed range (expect 400)
PUT http://{{base}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "A room too big", "capacity": 21 }

### 26. DELETE room 4 again (expect 404)
DELETE http://{{base}}/4

### 27. GET reservation 6, created by request 17 (expect 200, Kim, room 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/6

### 28. GET a reservation that does not exist (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/999

### 29. DELETE reservation 6 (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/6

### 30. DELETE reservation 6 again (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/6

### 31. GET reservation 6 after delete (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/6

### 32. PUT room 2, same values (expect 200, console: one select, no update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study Pod", "capacity": 4 }

### 33. PUT room 2, new values (expect 200, console: select + update)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Study Pod XL", "capacity": 6 }

### 34. GET room 99 (expect 404, ApiError body: room 99 not found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 35. DELETE room 1 (expect 409, ApiError body: room 1 has reservations)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### GET a URL that does not exist (expect 404, not 500)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nothing

### GET reservations without reservedBy (expect 400, required parameter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations

### POST room with capacity "ten" (expect 400, not valid JSON)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lab", "capacity": "ten" }

### GET room with a text id (expect 400, 'id' has the wrong type)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/abc